# Pairs with LinkedOnlyAfterSeed. A link reported before the donor is reparented leaves it naming the wrong parent.
MODULE: LinkedBeforeSeed
TARGET: LinkedOnlyAfterSeed
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the parent overflow reports the link before its sibling seeds the donor
PERTURBS: ParentOverflow

--- FIND
    /\ chain = "parent"
    /\ chain' = "seed"
    /\ seed' = "queued"
--- REPLACE
    /\ chain = "parent"
    \* MUTATION: the seeding is skipped
    /\ chain' = "return"
    /\ seed' = "queued"
--- END
